          </Text>
        <Text>
          <eid>NEgUZ6GKU7O_++eNbQo3BfG</eid>
          <style>subtitle</style>
          <size>9</size>
          <offset x="-0.201219" y="7.58538"/>
          <text><font size="9"></font>I don't know why I keep including this message about how I obviously didn't write the music I'm transcribing.
It's kind of pointless. I did it with the first thing I transcribed and then just kept going.
Anyway, I did not compose this.</text>
          </Text>
